   "kind": "say",
   "text": "What I need is someone who won't bolt when things get lean \u2014 last year half the pile was gone before most people blinked, and that tells me who looks out for themselves only. I've got food, I've got strength, and I'm young enough to think in decades. Question is whether you are too.",
