  {
   "eid": "e000561",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Bram gathers Ryn to talk.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 3
  },
  {
   "eid": "e000562",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "You've got food and you're not stupid \u2014 I'll give you that. But I've got Dell to think about, and Dav's still useful to her. What exactly are you offering that he isn't?",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 3
  },
  {
   "eid": "e000565",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Bram gathers Ryn to talk.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 3
  },
  {
   "eid": "e000566",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Dav's forty-three and his strength is in his arms, not his years \u2014 he won't be useful forever. I'm ten years younger than him, I've got food to spare, and I'm not splitting my attention between you and anyone else. That's what I'm offering.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 3
  },
  {
   "eid": "e000574",
   "kind": "pass",
   "text": "",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 3
  },
  {
   "eid": "e000577",
   "kind": "pass",
   "text": "",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 3
  },
  {
   "eid": "e000599",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Bram gathers Ryn to talk.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 3
  },
  {
   "eid": "e000600",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "You're right that Dav won't last \u2014 but ten years isn't a lifetime, and you've been alone three years already without making a move that stuck. What I want to know is whether you'll still be standing when it matters, or whether you'll fold the first time someone stronger comes for your food.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 3
  },
  {
   "eid": "e000604",
   "kind": "pass",
   "text": "",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 3
  },
  {
   "eid": "e000606",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Bram gathers Ryn to talk.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 3
  },
  {
   "eid": "e000607",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "I've held seven food through three lean years and nobody's taken a piece of it yet \u2014 that's your answer. I'm not asking you to trust me tomorrow, I'm asking you to look at what's in front of you: Mako's got six food and eighty-three strength and no one's given him a reason not to come for yours. I'd rather face that together than have you find out what alone costs when it's too late.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 3
  },
  {
   "eid": "e000611",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Bram gathers Ryn to talk.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 3
  },
  {
   "eid": "e000612",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Ryn, you've been circling this answer for three years \u2014 I'm done waiting for you to decide I'm worth the risk. Have a child with me: I'll put in two of the three food, you put in one, and whatever comes next we face with blood between us instead of just words.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 3
  },
