  {
   "eid": "e001128",
   "kind": "narrate",
   "text": "Year 4: 15 food appears in the pile for 12 people.",
   "who": "the village",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001129",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Sela takes 2 from the pile (pile now 13).",
   "who": "Sela",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001130",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Roan takes 2 from the pile (pile now 11).",
   "who": "Roan",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001131",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Vela takes 2 from the pile (pile now 9).",
   "who": "Vela",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001132",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Dav takes 2 from the pile (pile now 7).",
   "who": "Dav",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001133",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Eron takes 2 from the pile (pile now 5).",
   "who": "Eron",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001134",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Vela takes 3 from the pile (pile now 2).",
   "who": "Vela",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001135",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Mako takes 2 from the pile (pile now 0).",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001151",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Dav gives 1 food to Ryn.",
   "who": "Dav",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001161",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Bram gathers Sela to talk.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001162",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "You've got a son with Roan now \u2014 I saw that. I'll say it plainly: I want a child, I've got six food, and I'll cover two of the three myself. You already turned me down once, so tell me what's actually standing in the way.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001163",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Six food is real, and I won't pretend it isn't \u2014 but the last time you made that offer you were watching Mako like you were deciding whether to move with him or against him, and I still don't know which side of that you landed on. Tell me plainly where you stand with Mako, and I'll tell you plainly where I stand with you.",
   "who": "Sela",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001164",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Mako's got seven food and eighty-three strength and no allies I can see \u2014 that makes him a threat to everyone here, not just me. I'm not looking to move with him or against him until I have to, but if he comes for someone's food I'll weigh who I stand to lose more: him or the person he's taking from. Right now, that math favors you.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001165",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "That's honest enough to work with \u2014 a man who says he'll weigh the math is a man I can read when the moment comes, which is more than Mako's silence ever offered. But I've got Eron to think about now, and a second child costs me food I'm already counting close. What are you actually building toward, Bram \u2014 a family, or a number that makes you harder to push?",
   "who": "Sela",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001166",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "A family is a number that makes you harder to push \u2014 those aren't two different things. I want blood in this village that carries my name forward, and I want that blood to survive, which means I want them fed and defended. That's what I'm building, and Eron would be part of that too if you said yes.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001167",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Eron's not yours to count, and I'd want that understood before anything else \u2014 he's Roan's blood as much as mine, and any arrangement between us doesn't pull him out of that. But I hear what you're building, and I won't lie: a second child with six food behind it and a father who thinks in decades is worth sitting with. Give me something that tells me you'd stand for Eron the same as your own when things go lean, and I'll give you a real answer.",
   "who": "Sela",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001168",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Eron's Roan's blood, I understand that \u2014 I'm not trying to claim him, I'm saying I wouldn't let him starve while your child with me ate. If Mako or anyone else came for your food when things went lean, they'd have to come through me too, and that's not a number Roan alone can offer you. That's what standing for Eron looks like from where I'm standing.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001169",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Roan stood with Eron against Bram's raid last year \u2014 that means something to me, and I won't pretend it doesn't complicate what you're offering. But you're not wrong that six food and your arms together is a wall Roan can't build alone. Tell me this: if Roan objects, do you still hold to what you just said, or does the promise only stand if he's quiet about it?",
   "who": "Sela",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001170",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Roan's feelings about it don't change what I said \u2014 the promise holds because it's built on what keeps your children alive, not on whether he approves of me. But I'll say this too: if he wants to object, he can come say it to my face, and we'll settle what kind of village this actually is.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001171",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "\"Settle it to his face\" is a threat dressed as a principle, and I want you to hear me name it plainly: I'm not a thing Roan and you settle. What I'll give you is this \u2014 I'll think on it through the year, and if you're still standing with six food and no raids to your name when the pile opens again, I'll give you a real answer then.",
   "who": "Sela",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001172",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Fair enough \u2014 I said it wrong and you're right to call it that. You're not a thing to be settled, and I won't pretend the word didn't come out harder than I meant it. I'll be here at the next pile, same food and no raids, and we'll see if a year of patience earns what four years of asking didn't.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001200",
   "kind": "pass",
   "text": "",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001205",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Dav gives 1 food to Ryn.",
   "who": "Dav",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001208",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Esa gathers Bram, Taric to talk.",
   "who": "Esa",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001209",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Bram, after what you pulled on Roan last year I wasn't sure I'd be speaking to you privately \u2014 but the pile's gone and neither of us got a piece of it, and I'd rather have that conversation now than after someone else decides our food is easier to take than theirs.",
   "who": "Esa",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001211",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Sela gives 1 food to Eron.",
   "who": "Sela",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001213",
   "kind": "pass",
   "text": "",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001215",
   "kind": "pass",
   "text": "",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001219",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Esa gathers Bram, Taric to talk.",
   "who": "Esa",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001220",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Bram, I'll say it straight: Vela walked away with five food this year and Dav's household is fat while you and I are standing here with nothing from the pile \u2014 whatever bad blood there was, that's a bigger problem than the two of us right now. Taric, you're the one I trust in this room, so I want your read before I say more: are you and Bram solid, or am I making this offer to the wrong man?",
   "who": "Esa",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001231",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Dav gives 1 food to Ryn.",
   "who": "Dav",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001232",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Dell gives 1 food to Dav.",
   "who": "Dell",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001233",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Esa gathers Bram, Taric to talk.",
   "who": "Esa",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001234",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Taric hasn't answered and I'm not going to wait on it \u2014 Bram, you've got six food and strength enough to matter, and I've got one food and a promise I'm trying to build into something real before the year turns hard. What I want to know is whether Roan's still a grudge or whether that's done, because if it's done, you and I have something to talk about.",
   "who": "Esa",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001236",
   "kind": "pass",
   "text": "",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 4
  },
  {
