  {
   "eid": "e001772",
   "kind": "narrate",
   "text": "Year 5: 15 food appears in the pile for 12 people.",
   "who": "the village",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001773",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Bram takes 2 from the pile (pile now 13).",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001774",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Roan takes 2 from the pile (pile now 11).",
   "who": "Roan",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001775",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Esa takes 2 from the pile (pile now 9).",
   "who": "Esa",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001776",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Vela takes 2 from the pile (pile now 7).",
   "who": "Vela",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001777",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Kael takes 2 from the pile (pile now 5).",
   "who": "Kael",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001778",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Bram takes 2 from the pile (pile now 3).",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001779",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Mako takes 2 from the pile (pile now 1).",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001780",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Dav takes 1 from the pile (pile now 0).",
   "who": "Dav",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001807",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Bram gathers Sela to talk.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001808",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "The pile's gone and I've got twelve food \u2014 I said I'd be here, and I am. A year passed without a raid and without breaking a word I gave you. That offer still stands.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001809",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "You kept your word, and twelve food is real weight \u2014 I won't pretend it doesn't land differently now that I'm sitting on nothing. But Mako just found me and said words I haven't heard him say to anyone in four years, and I'd be a fool not to tell you that before you hear it sideways.",
   "who": "Sela",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001810",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "What did he say.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001811",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "He said he'd rather have one person he can trust at his back than stay comfortable while you sit on twelve food \u2014 and he named you by implication, not by accident. I don't know yet whether that's a man who's finally decided to move or a man who's decided I'm the easiest door to knock on first. Either way, you should know he's talking now.",
   "who": "Sela",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001812",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Mako's got eight food and eighty-three strength and he's just started talking \u2014 that's not a coincidence, and it's not small talk. If he's circling you it's because you've got nothing to take and you're not attached to anyone who'd stop him, which is exactly the problem I've been trying to fix for a year. Say yes to me now, and the next time he knocks on your door the math changes for both of us.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001813",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Bram, you're not wrong that the math changes \u2014 but I want to hear it said plainly: if I say yes, you're promising a child, not just a number at my back. Give me your word on that, clear as you gave it about the raid, and I'll give you my answer before you walk out this door.",
   "who": "Sela",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001814",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "You have my word \u2014 a child, not a number. I'll put in two food, you put in one, same as I offered the first time I asked. Say yes.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001815",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Yes \u2014 and I want it done before Mako comes back with another careful word, because a man who's waited four years to talk didn't choose today by accident.",
   "who": "Sela",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001816",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Then let's not give him time to think of a better word. I'll make the offer now \u2014 two food from me, one from you, and the child is ours.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001817",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Mako gives 1 food to Sela.",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001818",
   "kind": "proposal",
   "text": "Bram draws Sela aside to talk.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001819",
   "kind": "propose",
   "text": "Bram: have a child with me \u2014 I'll put in 2 of 3 food.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001820",
   "kind": "birth",
   "text": "Nessa (female, age 21; str 54, int 5179, mem 19355; O66 C54 E43 A45 N67) is born to Sela and Bram.",
   "who": "the village",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001821",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Dell gives 1 food to Dav.",
   "who": "Dell",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001859",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Ryn gives 1 food to Dell.",
   "who": "Ryn",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001869",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Bram gives 2 food to Nessa.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001870",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Dell gives 1 food to Dav.",
   "who": "Dell",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001874",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Ryn gives 1 food to Dell.",
   "who": "Ryn",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001877",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Bram gathers Nessa to talk.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001878",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "You're my blood, Nessa, and that means something real in a place like this \u2014 not words, real. I've got ten food and I'll teach you what I know about when to take and when to wait, but first I need to know you understand what this village will do to someone who looks weak.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001879",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "I understand it. I've watched Taric hold one food for three years running and nobody trades with him anymore \u2014 they don't fear him, they just don't think of him. But I want to know what you see in Mako, because he's not weak and he's not talking, and that worries me more than anyone who is.",
   "who": "Nessa",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001881",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Dav gives 1 food to Ryn.",
   "who": "Dav",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001883",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Bram gives 2 food to Nessa.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
